		dataType="Comment";
		class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-4};};
		title="Persistent-object guided example. This crate's stable key saves cargo and position but deliberately excludes damage, fuel and ammunition state. The public init call is locality-safe; do not add isServer. It only operates when persistence is enabled and the server has INIDBI2. Edit the named true/false options, or use the Minimal example to save every supported field. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Optional-Feature-Systems#persistence";
